{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T3y8UADVGFtFT4SZMJkCNo","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Anthropic prompt caching minimum cacheable prompt length tokens per model\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Enable prompt caching\",\"url\":\"https://docs.keywordsai.co/features/generation/prompt-caching\"},{\"title\":\"prompt caching\",\"url\":\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching\"},{\"title\":\"prompt caching\",\"url\":\"https://docs.keywordsai.co/documentation/products/gateway/performance_optimization/prompt-caching\"},{\"title\":\"> ## Documentation Index\",\"url\":\"https://docs.orq.ai/docs/ai-gateway/features/prompt-caching.md\"},{\"title\":\"> ## Documentation Index\",\"url\":\"https://www.truefoundry.com/docs/ai-gateway/chat-completions-prompt-caching.md\"},{\"title\":\"prompt caching\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching\"},{\"title\":\"prompt caching\",\"url\":\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching?stream=top\"},{\"title\":\"anthropic prompt caching\",\"url\":\"https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/integrations/llm/anthropic_prompt_caching/\"},{\"title\":\"prompt caching\",\"url\":\"https://docs.orq.ai/docs/ai-gateway/features/prompt-caching\"}]\n\nAnthropic's minimum cacheable prompt length appears to be 1,024 tokens for most Claude models, and 2,048 tokens for the Claude Haiku 3 and 3.5 models. I couldn't confirm the values for newer models from the results.\n\n- **1,024 tokens:** Third-party docs list this for Claude 3.5 Sonnet and Claude 3 Opus. Anthropic's official caching page lists 1024 tokens for Claude Opus 4, Claude Sonnet 4, Claude Sonnet 3.7, Claude Sonnet 3.5 and Claude Opus 3.\n- **2,048 tokens:** 2048 tokens for Claude 3.5 Haiku and Claude 3 Haiku, per a LlamaIndex integration page. A Keywords AI page gives the same figures. Any requests to cache fewer than this number of tokens will be processed without caching.\n- **Gaps:** The official Anthropic page snippets I received were truncated before the full minimum-length list, and I found no official figure for Claude Haiku 4.5 or Claude Opus 4.1. Check the current Anthropic prompt caching docs at docs.claude.com before relying on these numbers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"12edd7a3-9aa9-490c-a48e-e1cf262bb51c","uuid":"bfc01926-e4a3-4a53-af13-f3ce41563adb","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:05:28.205Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Anthropic prompt caching minimum cacheable prompt length tokens per model","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01TGMji1FmwS6H6RGATyjDnM","content":[{"title":"Enable prompt caching","url":"https://docs.keywordsai.co/features/generation/prompt-caching"},{"title":"prompt caching","url":"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching"},{"title":"prompt caching","url":"https://docs.keywordsai.co/documentation/products/gateway/performance_optimization/prompt-caching"},{"title":"> ## Documentation Index","url":"https://docs.orq.ai/docs/ai-gateway/features/prompt-caching.md"},{"title":"> ## Documentation Index","url":"https://www.truefoundry.com/docs/ai-gateway/chat-completions-prompt-caching.md"},{"title":"prompt caching","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching"},{"title":"prompt caching","url":"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching?stream=top"},{"title":"anthropic prompt caching","url":"https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/integrations/llm/anthropic_prompt_caching/"},{"title":"prompt caching","url":"https://docs.orq.ai/docs/ai-gateway/features/prompt-caching"}]},"Anthropic's minimum cacheable prompt length appears to be 1,024 tokens for most Claude models, and 2,048 tokens for the Claude Haiku 3 and 3.5 models. I couldn't confirm the values for newer models from the results.\n\n- **1,024 tokens:** Third-party docs list this for Claude 3.5 Sonnet and Claude 3 Opus. Anthropic's official caching page lists 1024 tokens for Claude Opus 4, Claude Sonnet 4, Claude Sonnet 3.7, Claude Sonnet 3.5 and Claude Opus 3.\n- **2,048 tokens:** 2048 tokens for Claude 3.5 Haiku and Claude 3 Haiku, per a LlamaIndex integration page. A Keywords AI page gives the same figures. Any requests to cache fewer than this number of tokens will be processed without caching.\n- **Gaps:** The official Anthropic page snippets I received were truncated before the full minimum-length list, and I found no official figure for Claude Haiku 4.5 or Claude Opus 4.1. Check the current Anthropic prompt caching docs at docs.claude.com before relying on these numbers."],"durationSeconds":6.276720583000002,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01T3y8UADVGFtFT4SZMJkCNo","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
